082074F0 vulcan-damage-update-return

The final palette call returns through r0. Response flags and timer
stores use other registers and preserve that Thumb return address.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/fn/sub_082074F0.c
